{
  "name": "14 · Feedback Follow-up (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 14 · Feedback Follow-up\nTwo days after a service or delivery it asks the customer \"is everything working well?\". Happy → AI thank-you. **Small issue, problem or angry** → the owner gets an alert and the customer gets a fixed message that the owner will call (the AI does not handle complaints).\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup).\n2. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Jobs**: Service date (yyyy-mm-dd), Name, Phone, Service.\n3. Replace YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP with the owner's WhatsApp number in 91XXXXXXXXXX format.\n4. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).",
        "height": 553,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "ff7c7b04-5c2e-444b-a357-0adf256a913c",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 11,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "bda92f4c-1827-4185-8669-52b4141de665",
      "name": "Daily 11 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Jobs"
        },
        "options": {},
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupColumn": "Service date",
              "lookupValue": "={{ $now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').minus({ days: 2 }).toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd') }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "6fa69697-90c4-4382-88ed-ac2d5faf4522",
      "name": "Services done 2 days ago",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        -160
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $json.Phone }}",
        "textBody": "=Hello {{ $json.Name }} ji, this is YOUR BUSINESS NAME 🙏 We did your {{ $json.Service }} 2 days ago. Is everything working well?\nReply: *1* all good · *2* small issue · *3* big problem",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "784559bc-8d46-4843-a9d7-b09756ce14d8",
      "name": "Ask how it went",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "messages"
        ]
      },
      "id": "05eac645-5973-456e-bfa2-93935aba7f72",
      "name": "Customer replies",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=A customer named {{ $json.contacts?.[0]?.profile?.name || '(name unknown)' }} replied to our check-in 2 days after a service visit: \"{{ $json.messages?.[0]?.text?.body }}\".\nstatus: happy (1, all good, thanks) | small_issue (2, minor problem) | problem (3, not working, needs a revisit) | angry (rude, threatening, wants money back).\nsummary: one line for the owner. reply: only for happy customers, a short warm thank-you (max 2 lines).\nRULES (never break these): You are an assistant for YOUR BUSINESS NAME, a small Indian business, not the owner. Never offer or hint at discounts, refunds, free items or compensation. Never promise delivery dates, results or guarantees that are not given in this prompt. Never invent prices, stock, policies or facts: use ONLY the data given in this prompt. Greet with 'Hello <name> ji' (never 'Namaste'). Reply in the customer's language (English, Hindi or Hinglish in Roman script).",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "d8b2d7cc-6e40-4f0e-8afa-fae481e883e9",
      "name": "AI checks reply",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "c46e3032-64a4-4592-a01e-ee294e0de626",
      "name": "AI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        180,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"status\": \"problem\",\n  \"summary\": \"washing machine leaking again after repair\",\n  \"reply\": \"\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "206d1364-5869-4221-ab86-f2ec0e489ee0",
      "name": "JSON shape",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        380,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.output.status !== 'happy' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3a067a68-1586-434c-a5af-0e2e5b502eb1",
      "name": "Problem or angry?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        680,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP",
        "textBody": "=⚠️ After-service check: {{ $('Customer replies').item.json.contacts?.[0]?.profile?.name || '' }} · {{ $('Customer replies').item.json.messages[0].from }}\n{{ $('AI checks reply').item.json.output.status.toUpperCase() }}: {{ $('AI checks reply').item.json.output.summary }}\nPlease call them today.",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "09409880-02ba-44fc-bd7e-7d800b8aafa3",
      "name": "Alert owner",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        920,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $('Customer replies').item.json.messages[0].from }}",
        "textBody": "=Sorry to hear that {{ $('Customer replies').item.json.contacts?.[0]?.profile?.name || '' }} ji 🙏 I have told the owner. You will get a call today to sort it out. – YOUR BUSINESS NAME",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "07fba3c7-790d-4df4-8802-fc1d9dfb42e8",
      "name": "Owner will call you",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1160,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $('Customer replies').item.json.messages[0].from }}",
        "textBody": "={{ $('AI checks reply').item.json.output.reply }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "bf429ceb-1483-4bb6-9367-9d7c2a64da63",
      "name": "Thank-you reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        920,
        340
      ]
    }
  ],
